{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The key understanding here is that you can factor a monomial in many different ways!\n\nTo check if any of the factorizations is correct, we can multiply the factors and see if their product is really $7x^6$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{3}\\maroonD{x^2})(\\blueD{4}\\maroonD{x^4})\u0026=(\\blueD{3})(\\blueD{4})(\\maroonD{x^2})(\\maroonD{x^4})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{12}\\maroonD{x^6}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Will is not correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{7}\\maroonD{x^2})(\\maroonD{x^3})\u0026=(\\blueD{7})(\\maroonD{x^2})(\\maroonD{x^3})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{7}\\maroonD{x^5}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Olivia is not correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Neither Will nor Olivia are correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Will factored $7x^6$ as $(3x^2)(4x^4)$.\n\nOlivia factored $7x^6$ as $(7x^2)(x^3)$.\n\n**Which of them factored $7x^6$ correctly?\n**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"Only Will","correct":false},{"content":"Only Olivia","correct":false},{"content":"Both Will and Olivia","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"Neither Will nor Olivia","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
